  <fr:mainmatter>
    <html:p>Macros for authoring <fr:link href="https://revealjs.com/" type="external">reveal.js</fr:link> decks in Forester.
Set the layout meta to <html:code>reveal</html:code> on the deck tree to switch into slide
mode. Each top-level transcluded tree becomes a slide; use vstack to nest
slides vertically and fragment for staged reveals.</html:p>
    <html:p>Auto-animate authoring. <html:code>slideAnim</html:code> opens a slide that tweens matching
elements to/from its neighbours; <html:code>anim</html:code> tags one movable token with a stable
id so reveal carries it across slides (matched ids glide, unmatched fade).</html:p>
  </fr:mainmatter>
